  "separation": [
    "Owned compositor surface observation changes no application policy or widget rendering.",
    "GTK geometry transport uses public GDK, Wayland and GLib; it has no NativeUI provider dependency.",
    "The pinned Gecko consumer adds the missing surface origin to the original bounds calculation and reuses original window/content notifications.",
    "Native controls, tracking, layout and shortcut matching remain in the shared GNUstep provider.",
    "Browser-owned tabs, address bar and toolbar are preserved by default; optional app patches above the shared bridge are future scope."
  ],
